# Catalog data

Keep existing field names in `types.ts`. Routes reference `originCityId`, `destinationCityId`, `carrierIds[]` and optional `deskId` — never infer a desk from UI copy.

`status: "commercial"` — listed on `/routes/`, homepage index, sitemap, and homepage search navigation.
`status: "editorial"` — page may exist, `noindex`, not in the public index or search results (`findRouteByCities(..., { commercialOnly: true })`).

Forbidden on a route record: duration, timetable, stops-as-itinerary, trip distance, departure times, price, availability, ratings. Unverified details go in `whatToConfirm`.

Carrier `claims[]` must include `sourceUrl` and `lastVerifiedAt`. An empty list is correct until verified. Current Koval claims are the matrix-approved set dated 2026-09-11.

City `aliases` are search-only — never URLs.
